denied:
  - commands:
      - shutdown
      - reboot
    reason: Ask first.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
$ROOT % shutdown now
deny: Command matches a denied rule: shutdown. Ask first.

$ROOT % reboot now
deny: Command matches a denied rule: reboot. Ask first.
